 schedule, choosing the reunion, alumni, or athletics activities that match your campus connection.","short_summary":"Homecoming reconnects students and alumni through school-spirit events rooted in a 1978 first edition.","evidence_claim":"GVSU’s official Homecoming page dates the university’s first Homecoming to 1978 and presents its festivities and fight song as foundational traditions.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/homecoming","source_title":"Homecoming","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Individual Homecoming activities may have separate registration, admission, or eligibility requirements; check each listing.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-victory-fight-song","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"GVSU Victory","title":"Raise Your Voice for GVSU Victory","subtitle":"The fight song whose lyrics won a 1978 campus contest","notes":"Learn the official words before a game, then join the crowd when the song is performed rather than improvising another version.","short_summary":"A $50 lyric contest supplied the words Lakers still sing with their university fight song.","evidence_claim":"GVSU reports that two marching-band members won a 1978 campuswide contest to write lyrics for William Root’s fight song, GVSU Victory.","source_url":"https://www.gvsu.edu/gvnext/2023/homecoming-legacy-band-members-pen-words-to-fight-song-win-50.htm","source_title":"Homecoming legacy: Band members pen words to fight song, win $50","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-10-20","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The song can be heard at university athletics and marching-band appearances; event access rules vary.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gvsu-louie-the-laker","subject_type":"tradition","entity_